{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31065","headline":"上盐铁尚书 · 薛能","name":"上盐铁尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南宫环雉隔嚣尘，况值清斋宿大臣。\n城绝鼓钟更点後，雨凉烟树月华新。\n檐前漱晓穹苍碧，庭下眠秋沆瀣津。\n闻说务闲心更静，此时忧国合求人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31065.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31065","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}